CM_ SG_ 797 ETS_MCU_StatusBits_St_enum "MCU Status bits
Off - MCU is powered off
Initialize - MCU is powered ON and it is in initialisation state of Ios
Ready - MCU has initialised all Inputs and outputs and ready to process all commands
Fault: Fault is MCU or Motor due to which MCU can not allow to drive motor
Active Shortcircuiting: Active shortcircuiting activated by MCU
Derated Performance: MCU not able working in derated mode due to warning or error";
CM_ SG_ 797 ETS_MCU_MotDrvRdyStatus_St_enum " Drive readiness status of MCU.
MCU Ready means there is no fault related to MCU or Motor, MCU enable is not activated by VCU and it can follow the VCU commands to drive motor.
MCU Not Ready means either there is fault related to MCU or Motor or MCU enable is not activated by VCU and MCU can not allow to drive motor
";
